WEBVTT

00:05:58.969 --> 00:06:03.447
for almost one half
of the world's military spending.

00:06:04.264 --> 00:06:06.256
Four percent of the world's population!

00:06:06.280 --> 00:06:08.824
And you feel it; you see it every day.

00:06:08.848 --> 00:06:10.170
It's part of your life.

00:06:10.194 --> 00:06:12.972
And you talk about it with your friends.

00:06:12.996 --> 00:06:14.584
You read about it.

00:06:14.608 --> 00:06:17.839
And back when Saddam Hussein was in power,

00:06:18.486 --> 00:06:21.387
the Americans didn't care
about his crimes.

00:06:21.411 --> 00:06:23.828
When he was gassing
the Kurds and gassing Iran,

00:06:23.852 --> 00:06:25.327
they didn't care about it.

00:06:25.351 --> 00:06:27.430
When oil was at stake,

00:06:27.454 --> 00:06:30.914
somehow, suddenly, things mattered.